# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto eol=lf

# Rust
*.rs text diff=rust
# Cargo.lock must stay reviewable: with `-diff` git renders it as
# "Bin N -> M bytes" and a stale lockfile silently reverting a dependency bump
# is invisible in review. That is exactly how PR #1077 reverted PR #1057's
# quinn-udp 0.5.16 security fix without anyone seeing it.
Cargo.lock text diff

# Config / docs
*.toml text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.md text diff=markdown
*.json text

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary

# Preserved patch series and combined diffs must be byte-exact. Line-ending
# normalisation would rewrite their content and they could no longer reproduce
# the tree they were verified against.
*.patch -text
*.diff  -text
